{"title":"Career roadmap · Housekeeping Supervisor","role":"Housekeeping Supervisor","summary":"Career alignment: A Housekeeping Supervisor is responsible for supervising room and public-area cleanliness, assigning staff, monitoring quality standards, coordinating with front office and maintenance, managing supplies, handling guest requests and ensuring that housekeeping operations meet hotel standards.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is an operations-heavy hospitality career. The strongest candidates combine hotel operations + people management + quality control + inventory + guest service + technology + cost awareness."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Housekeeping Associate / Room Attendant"},{"text":"Room and public-area operations"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Housekeeping Supervisor"},{"text":"Staff supervision and quality"}],[{"text":"3–5 years"},{"text":"Assistant Executive Housekeeper"},{"text":"Department coordination"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Executive Housekeeper"},{"text":"Full housekeeping department"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Director of Housekeeping / Rooms Division Manager"},{"text":"Department/rooms leadership"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Director of Rooms / Hotel Operations Manager"},{"text":"Property-wide operations"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"General Manager / Hotel Operations Head"},{"text":"Entire hotel business"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Hospitality & Housekeeping Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotel organisation"},{"text":"Front office"},{"text":"Housekeeping"},{"text":"Food & beverage"},{"text":"Sales & ma