ice"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cost management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Department budgets"},{"text":"Labour cost"},{"text":"Chemical consumption"},{"text":"Linen cost"},{"text":"Amenity cost"},{"text":"Equipment cost"},{"text":"Cost per occupied room"},{"text":"Waste reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Productivity"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rooms cleaned per attendant"},{"text":"Cleaning time"},{"text":"Labour productivity"},{"text":"Overtime"},{"text":"Absenteeism"},{"text":"Room turnaround time"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Productivity targets vary by property, room type, occupancy and operating model; they should not be treated as universal fixed numbers."},{"type":"h","text":"Hotel technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Property Management Systems"},{"text":"Housekeeping management systems"},{"text":"Room-status systems"},{"text":"Work-order systems"},{"text":"Inventory systems"},{"text":"Mobile housekeeping applications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Hotel Housekeeping Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Occupancy"},{"text":"Room status"},{"text":"Cleaning productivity"},{"text":"Room turnaround"},{"text":"Complaints"},{"text":"Linen usage"},{"text":"Chemical usage"},{"text":"Labour hours"},{"text":"Cost per occupied room"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Leadership, Revenue Awareness & Smart Hospitality"},{"type":"h","text":"Department leadership"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"Shift management"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Cross-departme